From c1be0bc7d8cb301dfe1df68e41125e74093c2f54 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devi Priya <devipriy@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Feb 2026 14:31:58 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] arch: arm: dts: Patch DTs with Booted bank info

Read the booted bank info from IMEM and patch this information to
the /chosen node in both the U-Boot and kernel device trees during
their respective fixup stages.

Additionally, append PARTLABEL=rootfs-active or
PARTLABEL=rootfs-inactive to the kernel command line, depending on
the boot bank value read from IMEM. This ensures the kernel selects
the correct root filesystem based on the currently active boot bank.

Change-Id: I5329f94910741a0f2df41d5af15023360fc6ed5c
Signed-off-by: Devi Priya <devipriy@qti.qualcomm.com>
---

